## JSDoc Best Practices

Always document:
1. What the prop does
2. Default value (if any)
3. Example usage (for complex props)

```typescript
/**
 * Configuration for tooltip behavior
 *
 * @example
 * ```tsx
 * <Component tooltip={{ content: 'Help text', placement: 'top' }} />
 * ```
 */
tooltip?: {
  content: string
  placement?: 'top' | 'bottom' | 'left' | 'right'
}
```
